---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { CVR, EMAIL } from '../../i18n/ui';
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  page="privacy"
  title="Privacy policy – FremVærk"
  description="How FremVærk processes data when you use fremvaerk.dk and the contact form."
>
  <article class="container prose">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated 22 November 2026</p>

    <h2>Data controller</h2>
    <p>
      FremVærk, CVR {CVR}, Birkerød, Denmark, is the data controller for the data we receive through
      this site. You can contact us at <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>
      The site sets no cookies and uses no analytics or statistics tools. The site does not load
      content from other services when you visit it.
    </p>

    <h2>The contact form</h2>
    <p>
      When you send the contact form, we receive your name, email address and message. Netlify, our
      data processor, processes the form. We only use the data to reply to your message. The legal
      basis is our legitimate interest in replying to messages (GDPR Article 6(1)(f)).
    </p>
    <p>We keep the data for [12 months] after our last contact with you, and then we delete it.</p>

    <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
    <p>
      Netlify hosts the site. Netlify keeps standard server logs, for example the IP address, the time,
      the page that was requested and the browser type. The logs are used to run and protect the
      service. Netlify can process data outside the EU. [The transfer basis, for example the European
      Commission's standard contractual clauses, must be confirmed.]
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) you have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>get access to the data we have about you</li>
      <li>have incorrect data corrected</li>
      <li>have the data deleted</li>
      <li>restrict or object to the processing</li>
      <li>receive the data in a common format (data portability)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Write to <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a> if you want to use your rights.</p>

    <h2>Complaints</h2>
    <p>
      You can complain about how we process your data to the Danish Data Protection Agency
      (Datatilsynet), <a href="https://www.datatilsynet.dk/">datatilsynet.dk</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
